window.products.push({"id":817080,"name":"Huanyu Manual Tornado Potato Slicer Cutter Hand Spiral Vegetable Slicer Spiral Twisted Potato Chips Making Machine Curly Fries Maker for Sweet Potatoe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yt9XA6Y5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Dual function] Two functional blades, easy to replace, can make classic potato tornado, and can also make potato tornado with sausage in the middle, providing more creative production, and manual type to enjoy more hands-on fun! [Adjustable thickness & Safety] refined stainless steel, hard and sharp, adjustable thickness! ! The cutting process is more labor-saving and simple, and the enclosed internal protection prevents injuries. [Sturdy body] ABS food grade material: made of thick ABS plastic, durable, easy to clean, light in weight, small in size, easy to store and use; stainless steel screws, aluminum core rocker, super durable design. [Slope design] Innovative slope type instead of horizontal type, while satisfying more operating habits, not only can avoid the sliding of the fuselage, but also can ensure that the tornado is not broken and save potatoes. [Surprise] Not only potatoes, but also sweet potatoes, carrots, white radishes, and cucumbers! It can turn simple ingredients into a lively and interesting appearance. With it, let the children enjoy the fun of the family kitchen together! Let children fall in love with vegetables and fruits! This is also a beautiful and interesting gift for your loved one! The pink ones are cuter! (B078KRW7PN)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yt9XA6Y5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Huanyu","source_asin":"B078KRW7PN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078KRW7PN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078KRW7PN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":817081,"name":"Saffron Marigold 70x90 Tropical Garden Decorative Table Cloth | Red Hibiscus Floral | Country Western Vintage Flower Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":110.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91An5G7CRQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Key Features Printed on preshrunk, superior grade, soft cotton Floral Print Variations: 70, 90 round, 70x90, 70x108, 70x120 Machine wash cold Spread this tablecloth and your room will take on a vibrant ambience, evocative of the rich imagery of the tropics.Toss out all rules and embrace the vivid print with colorful plates and dishes like earthy reds and oranges, sunny yellows and cool blues and greens. Serve your guests casual fare like chips and crudites with fiery salsas and cool creamy dips. Each piece is handcrafted using intricately hand carved wooden blocks and is an original work of art distinguished by the work of the artisan, the particular lot of dye, and even varying weather conditions. Tonal variations are inherent to the block printing process and enhance the individuality, character and uniqueness of each creation. Inspiration for Tropical Garden: With its gloriously evocative tropical palette and patterning, this design profoundly captures the experience of standing in a tropical garden on a brilliant summer day. Set against a deep honey gold sun drenched ground, replete with riotously blooming deep red hibiscus blossoms and multi colored star gazer lilies hanging languidly from lush verdant vines ... you might find yourself trying to catch a whiff of the heady fragrance of the blossoms, the leaves and the sun baked earth as they waft atop the salt laden breeze.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91An5G7CRQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saffron Marigold","source_asin":"B07CMCH61V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CMCH61V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CMCH61V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
