window.products.push({"id":817189,"name":"Martha Stewart Living 4.5 ft. 18-Light Warm White LED Snowman Ultra Wire Light Battery Operated","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j06vowRWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Make your decorations stand out with the Martha Stewart 4.5 ft. 18-count Warm White LED Snowman Ultra-Slim Wire Light. These Christmas lights have a battery-operated timer for six hours on and 18 hours off, providing effortless operation through the holiday season. They offer different light modes such as flashing, phasing and steady on. It is a unique decoration with a Christmas theme. 4.5 ft. lighted length with 18 snowman-shaped LED bulbs in warm white Automatic timer for 6 hours on and 18 hours off Long-lasting LED lights draw 80% less power than traditional incandescent bulbs Intended as decoration only, not as a toy Requires 3 AA batteries (sold separately)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j06vowRWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MARTHA STEWART","source_asin":"B01MTR3E9M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MTR3E9M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MTR3E9M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":817190,"name":"Seatcraft Republic Home Theater Seating - Top Grain Leather - Power Recline - Power Headrest - Center Storage Console - Cupholders - USB Charging - in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1922.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZrIvRnuiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Seat craft Republic home theater seat boasts a striking look that will accommodate guests for years to come. This seat is constructed from grade 7000 leather, for a luxurious sheen that is picked from the top third of all hides. The seat backs of the Republic are firmly bolstered, with adjustable power headrests that let you find and switch positions with the simple push of a button. The contrast stitching running across the chair gives it a sense of character.  ambient base lighting adds an azure marquee accent, while lighted cup holders keep beverages secure and within arm's reach. Each Armrest flips up to reveal plenty of in-arm storage for an easy cleanup of essential items after use. An accessory mount attached to the Armrest expands the range of Entertainment opportunities at your fingertips, by letting you attach any number of exciting accessories including wine glass caddies, tablets, reading lights and more. Taken together, its eye-catching look and plethora of features make the Republic a must-have among the Seat craft line. features leather gel power recliners adjustable powered headrest large center storage console's hidden in-arm storage compartments ambient lighted cup holders USB charging wall Hugger recline item specifications Loveseat Dimensions: 44\" h x 72\" W x 38\" d fully reclined: 65\" d wall Hugger: 6\" package includes 1 x Loveseat 2 x tray tables assembly furniture arrives Partially assembled with backrests detached for easy-moving","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZrIvRnuiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seatcraft","source_asin":"B0711NBFQL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0711NBFQL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0711NBFQL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
