window.products.push({"id":817215,"name":"Zesthouse Modern Sherpa Accent Chairs Armchairs for Living Dining Room, Upholstered Barrel Chairs with Metal Legs, Comfy Lounge Sofa Chairs for Living","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tnB1agq4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♞MODERN DESIGN: On account of the perfect fusion of modern style and elegance, most people will be obsessed with the excellent shape of this accent chair at a first glance. The streamlined silhouettes with half-embracing back can decorate any imaginative interiors or stunning spaces. These curved armrests with an arched design showcase a novel pattern and a treasured idea which provide more comfort in terms of ergonomics. ♘PROFESSIONALLY CRAFTED: This elegant accent chair features high-quality upholstery, curvaceous profile and rich texture. Meticulous sewing craftsmanship conveys professional and rigorous attitude. Sherpa dining room chair also enhances modern flair with its classic design, creating a warm vibe in any interior simultaneously due to its spotlight on comfort. Position this armchair to draw compliments from guests and command respects. ♔VERSATILE MASTERPIECE: What a cozy scene! It’s self-explanatory that this small lounge sofa chair will become a catalyst for a better life. Emerging as a desk chair for living room and upholstered dining room chair, it boasts clear-cut lines and seductive silhouettes and can rise to the occasion at any time. Apart from increasing the exuberance of your decor, whether you are chatting, having dinner or dressing up, the glamorous accent armchair will stand out in a trend-setting way. ♕PREMIUM MATERIAL: The skin-friendly sherpa fabric is insulating that retains much of its insulating properties when wet, and is highly breathable, machine-washable, and quick drying. The coated stainless metal legs are both lightweight and stable with a fabulous load-bearing capacity. Meanwhile the anti-scratches and anti-noise pads equipped by feet protect your floor on the one hand and the slip resistant characteristic ensures your safety on the other hand. ♝ASSEMBLY: Easy to assemble. We provide all the necessary hardware and tool, and an illustrated installation manual. You can free up more time to spend with family and play with friends. If you have any problems or questions, please feel free to contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tnB1agq4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zesthouse","source_asin":"B09B4QDWF1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817215","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B4QDWF1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B4QDWF1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
