window.products.push({"id":817234,"name":"5 Ft Pop Up Christmas Tinsel Tree with 100 Colorful LED Lights, Collapsible Pencil Christmas Tree with Remote & APP Control, Christmas Decorations for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811Lmmriy6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎄【2022 Newest Artificial Christmas Tree】5ft pop up Christmas tree is made of high quality pvc material, plastic four-legged and sturdy metal stand give skinny Christmas tree extra durability and stability. Special USB interface charging method - only need to fully charge the power bank to create Xmas atmosphere indoors and outdoors (the power bank is not included in the package and the silver star topper will not change lights with the remote.) 🎄【Easy to Assemble】Just simply assemble the brackets and easily set up and take down the artificial pencil Christmas tree with light strings in 2 minutes, no extra tools required, and the 13.7\" diameter is perfect for any space! And you don't need to search for bulky Christmas tree storage bag like in previous years, because it may even take up less space(13\"x12\"x7\") than kid’s Christmas train box, reusable and durable PVC material will save you a lot of money every Christmas. 💡【DIY 100 LED String Lights】The LED Christmas tree lights can be controlled by app, 16 million colors for you to choose. More surprising is the music synchronization function, imagine on Christmas, children gather around the tinsel Xmas tree to try out what colors their voices will create, or play your favorite music to make the Christmas tree lights change by the rhythm, this is destined to be an unforgettable night! ❄️【24 Hour Timer】Not only does the remote control provide 4/8 hour lighting timer setting, but the app can be timed to every MINUTE you want, just like your phone clock and further saving power for you. String lights provide other 6 smart scenes and you can also choose the color according to the camera shot, so that the lights will blend in with surrounding scenery. Perfect for indoor and outdoor parties, birthdays, New Year, Halloween, Christmas, anniversaries decor. 🎄【Christmas Decorations】Collapsible Christmas tree is packaged in a unique blue Christmas gift box, and string lights are also equipped with a special winder to help you keep away from mess. Will be your perfect Christmas gift choice and Xmas decorations for party, doorway, living room, fireplace, backyard, next to the stairs, balcony, shopping mall, children's room, etc. Your support gives us continuous motivation. If you have any questions during the use, please feel free to connect us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811Lmmriy6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fortuning's JDS","source_asin":"B0B8RWBV2R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8RWBV2R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8RWBV2R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
