window.products.push({"id":817242,"name":"SIGNORA WARE Signoraware Stainless Steel Bento Lunch Box | 20-Ounce Eco Friendly Portion Control Lunchbox Containers | 2-Compartment Metal Food Pail W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714Fm+bjyiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"➤ Are you looking for a more modern, convenient way to take your food on-the-go? ➤ Have you tried other stainless steel lunch boxes in the past but couldn’t keep the food separated in the compartments, which created quite a mess? If so, today is your lucky day! Our bento boxes are everything you could possibly want in a reusable lunch pail and so much more! It’s no secret that you should try to keep your food away from plastic. Especially hot food. It can expose you to BPA, which we now know can cause a whole host of problems. Plus, most plastic products are harmful to the environment.That’s the beauty of these food containers. They’re made from stainless steel, which is the most convenient and safest way to store food. Glass containers are safe but super fragile. One accident and your food is gone! Our lunchboxes allow you to pack delicious, healthy lunches for school, work, the beach, picnic, and more. You’ll also notice that your food tastes better when it’s stored in stainless steel as opposed to plastic! Product Features and Benefits: 🥡 Made from 18/8 stainless steel🥡 Equipped with two separate compartments🥡 Large 20-ounce capacity🥡 Includes a lid that prevents leaks/spills🥡 Suitable for hot and cold foods🥡 Wash in the dishwasher and reuse Preserve Freshness… Live Fresh We’re determined to provide the best products made from the highest quality materials to the global market.We’re proud to have an in-house R&D department with CNC machines to design and develop our own molds with the latest technology. Our products are manufactured by adopting modern technology and special grade raw material. Rest assured, knowing that you’re getting the best at a very competitive price. Don’t delay, click the “Add to Cart” button today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714Fm+bjyiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIGNORA WARE","source_asin":"B0BVXNVZN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVXNVZN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVXNVZN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
