window.products.push({"id":817269,"name":"12 Inch Gold Lace Doilies Paper Round Placemats Decorative Doilies Paper Placemat- Eco-Friendly for Cake, Desert, Wedding, Tableware Decoration (100pc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IM0hckG9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Display your creation on a platform worthy of it. Paper lace doilies are perfect for serving your creation with pride and adding professional look to your table. Our round shape paper lace doilies are sturdy and provide a solid support to your appetizers, dessert and much more… Look fantastic placed under cakes, tea cakes, or other dessert items. Also can serve as cake mats, can place them under trays, glasses, butter, flower vases and so on.  Use paper doilies to make beautiful arts and crafts such as scrapbooking and making doily cards. Pack contains 12inch round shape paper doilies assorted quantity (50/100pcs).Perfect for exactly what you need!  Our paper lace doilies are safe to use with food items. These paper laces doilies are disposable. Throw away these disposable doilies once used without the worry of washing or storing.  We offer quality products at an affordable price to help you arrange a perfect party. Customer satisfaction is our top priority. If u have any issues related to our product feel free to contact us we are always here for you! Wide Application: These lace doilies can be applied to dress up a table display and decorate plate, cups, wedding tray, vases, platter, plate, gift bags, cards, etc. The doilies can be easily separated from each other, convenient to add more fancy and elegance to your art and craft projects. Fit for festive occasions like Christmas parties, Valentine's parties, weddings, anniversaries and other celebrations that needs extra elegance. Usage: to protect the table cloth. Protect table cloth from grease, stains and other attacks, especially for cotton tablecloth. Specifications: Material: durable paper Color: gold Diameter: 12 inch Package Content: 100 x Round gold paper doilies","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IM0hckG9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mlykya","source_asin":"B08ZJJDGQS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZJJDGQS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZJJDGQS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":817270,"name":"(6-Pack Bundle) Fresh Flow Compatible Air Filter + Produce Preserver Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tmUUIgUXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"To Replace Your Produce Preserver: 1) Find the Produce Preserver housing inside the refrigerator. 2) Open the housing by pulling up and out on the back. 3)Remove the Produce Preserver pouches from the packaging and place them into the housing. To Replace Your Air Filter: 1) Locate the filter cover at the top of the interior wall of the refrigerator2) Lift open the vented door3) Remove old filter by squeezing tabs together and pull out4) Insert new filter About the Produce Preserver Fruits and vegetables produce a naturally occurring chemical called Ethylene. Ethylene induces natural ripening in fruits and vegetables. In fact, a number of fruits and vegetables emit small amounts of ethylene gas during their ripening process which leads to an increased level of ethylene gas in the air. This in turn threatens the life cycle of post-harvest fruits and vegetables. Our preservers work by absorbing the ethylene gas that produce naturally gives off lengthening the life of produce About the Air Filter The air filter is installed in front of an air vent which actively pushes air through the filter. Our premium air filter works nonstop to filter the air in your refrigerator eliminating odors naturally and keeping the refrigerator smelling fresh. Our filter is proven to be fifteen times more effective then baking soda. Additional Information: In this bundle, you will receive enough preservers for 6 uses, along with 6 air filters. Each pack can last up to 6 months. Please note that the indicator strips are not included in this sale You Should Know We are not affiliated with , nor are these products made by Whirlpool .. The Whirlpool , KitchenAid and FreshFlow brand names and logos are the registered trademarks of their owners. Any use of any aforementioned brand names are made solely for purposes of illustrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tmUUIgUXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Natural Filters","source_asin":"B01N4U3OL5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N4U3OL5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N4U3OL5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
