window.products.push({"id":817340,"name":"Weddings-by-StockingFactory Mr. and Mrs. Personalized Hand Made Wood Guest Book Engraved Couples Names Reception Sign in Newlywed Guestbook Reception","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZuW7vNTyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Hand Made in the USA from local and sustainable wood. Thank you for purchasing from USA Artisans -your neighbors -It does make a huge difference. Unique and Handmade Guestbook will keep precious memories of the special day. Wooden cover: personalized engraved to make it a forever keepsake. MATERIALS The front and back covers are Birch Wood, stained to finish of your choice: Black, Mahogany, Burnt Cocoa or Carmel Oak.The engraving then reveals the light birch wood color with a gorgeous contrast. You also have the choice between Two Sizes, Larger Version 11\" x 8.5\" or Medium Size 8.5\" x 7\" ★ Paper is hand cut and available in BLANK IVORY 24Lb or LINED IVORY 24LB weight paper or ALL BLACK CARDSTOCK 65lb weight paper which we recommend if you plan to use the guestbook as a photo guestbook album not only with writing but also with instant wedding photos.★ Stanard 80 pages (40 sheets) ( ivory pages can be upgraded to 120 pages /60 sheets) & the page design can also be customized: Choose blank pages, or lined pages. ★ Album held together with 1-inch diameter Black Spiral Binding or 1-1/4\" diameter binding for all black album pages. It is plenty big so if you use the guestbook as album and add photos, the guestbook will still close fine. TO PLACE AN ORDER ★ Please take a look at all images to see all options, there are small thumbnail images by the main image. ★ Click the CUSTOMIZE NOW button, In YELLOW & in Top Right Corner and enter your Customization details on the pop-up page (your pers, size of book, type of paper & stain finish). ★ Once you fill in the personalization details, the very top will have ADD TO CART BUTTON and you will be able to add the customized item to cart and checkout. PROCESSING:Proudly made in the FLORIDA KEYS. Please allow 3-5 business days for customization and production of your keepsake.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZuW7vNTyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Weddings-by-StockingFactory","source_asin":"B07N982WYS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N982WYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N982WYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
