window.products.push({"id":817462,"name":"Set of 8, Stackable Clear Bins with Removable Dividers - Food Snack Organizer, Pantry Organization and Storage - Plastic Home Containers - Refrigerato","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tUksJPuSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"8 PACK OF PREMIUM ORGANIZERS: Package comes with 8 clear plastic organizers that each of 11.6”L x 6.4”W x 3.4”H with 2 removable dividers. The bins are sturdy, strong and durable with thick high-quality BPA-free plastic, and the clear body makes items inside easy and quickly to see, grab and go. REMOVABLE DIVIDERS FOR CUSTOMIZING SPACES: The dividers contained in the bin can be used to separate items in preferred widths like undivided, divided in half or 3 ways according to your storage needs, and you can easily switch the size up depending the items size. Easy to side them in and out and when installed, the dividers stuck firmly in the bins without popping out. ORGANIZERS ARE STACKABLE: If you are confused about how to solve the space utilization problem, then these bins are the great answer, our organizers can be stacked when dividers in, so you can stack them to 2, 3 or 4 layers if you want, saving storage spaces for convenient storage and all the items in still easy to see. HANDLES FOR EASY PULLING OUT & CARRYING: Handles on both sides make it easy to quickly pull the things out of a pantry or cabinet, where items can be difficult to retrieve or pick up in these tight spaces. And if you need to move these bins elsewhere like from countertop to refrigerator, the handles will help you a lot, especially if the items inside are full and heavy. PROVIDES VERSATILE STORAGE OPTIONS: These bins are not just ideal for foods, snacks, tea bags, seasoning sauces packets, spices, various small packets pouches, fruits, vegetables, drinks, cans, coca cola, yogurts storage, but also for organizing your makeup, tools, office supplies, toiletries, cleaning supplies, etc. Provides multiple uses in any room like pantry, cabinet shelf, bathroom, vanity, refrigerator, freezer, kitchen, office, garages, playroom, drawer, rv and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tUksJPuSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LANDNEOO","source_asin":"B0B8N8WR2C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817462","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8N8WR2C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8N8WR2C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":817463,"name":"TOPDURE 26.5 feet 7.5W/ft Pipe Heating Cable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UCM8a1tDL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Durable and reliable : designed for use in water filled plastic (including PEX) or metal pipes up to 1-1/2\" diameter. The lowest installation temperature of the heating cable is 14℉. 120V, 7.5W/ft. Keep water flowing down to -40℉. Energy Saving Thermostat: Secure the thermostat(plug end) tightly against the pipe(the coldest end of the pipe).The built-in thermostat automatically turns cable 37℉ on and 50℉ off. More efficient, saving you money on your utility bills. Easy to install: Pre-assembled to use out of the box. Keep the cable straight-traced on the pipe and valve, affix with a good electrical tape and insulation. Never spiral. Never crossing. Never overlap itself. Heavy duty: Both CSA and ETL approved. Cable is made of tough XLPE inner insulation, a continuous ground braid, and a weather-resistant PVC outer jacket. Grounded plug with pilot light. Waterproof grade is IP65. The 6ft power cord makes this product ideal for extended use. 2-year limited warranty. Testing before installing: Plug in the cable, insert the thermostat part of the cable into an ice bucket for a few minutes. When the temperature is below 37℉, the thermostat will activate the cable to function. It usually feels warm to the touch in a few minutes. To avoid overheating, please don't plug it in for a long time for testing. You should turn off the cable once you feel the slight warm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UCM8a1tDL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOPDURE","source_asin":"B07SZSY6ZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SZSY6ZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SZSY6ZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
