window.products.push({"id":817646,"name":"Manual Can Opener,3-In-1 Multifunctional Can Openers with Comfortable Handle and Knob Smooth Edge Safely Cut,Save time and Effort,for Seniors with Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uoC2mY-sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Choose our Manual 3-IN-1 Can Opener?1.Easy to use:Large knob and easy to grasp, save time and effort, easy to open cans.2.Using safety: After cutting, the can cover is smooth and delicate, no metal chips will not fall into the food, and it is very safe to protect the fingers from being hurt by the sharp blade.3.High Quality:made of the highest quality 430 stainless steel with electroplating process and high quality plastic,Long term use will not rust and bend.4.Easy to clean,store and carry:Made of stainless steel,can washed in the sink or Dishwasher safe.With tail holes at the end of the handle can be hung on the wall to save space.Small and delicate easy to store in kitchen and carry for outdoor.5.Multifunctional:3-IN-1 multifunction opener can be used as a can opener, lever, bottle opener, suitable for all kinds of cans and bottles.6.Modern unique design:Unique and Thoughtful Design,more comfortable than traditional can opener,great for woman and arthritis older.Tips:How to use:Step 1:Open the handle, the blade and gear will also be opened at the same time, and then clamp the circular blade and gear up and down to the can that needs to be opened.Step 2:Then clamp the two handles lightly and firmly. At this time, the knife will cut into the tin can and make a click sound at the same time.Step 3:Turn the handle clockwise and move along the edge of the can.Step 4:Don't need open the can lip completely and lift lid up,then you can enjoy the delicious food.Kindly notes for safety and maintenance:1.Be careful of sharp blades to prevent injury.2.must turn the handle clockwise, otherwise the product will be damaged.3.Not suitable for kids.4.Dry it after cleaning. Store it at dry places.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uoC2mY-sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JJJ","source_asin":"B08TVVXPCB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TVVXPCB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TVVXPCB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
