window.products.push({"id":817780,"name":"Egg Shape Pepper Shaker Pot Standard Workmanship Preservative Pepper Can Spice Jar Bottles for Household for Kitchen(Single Hole)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613j+UlLCHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features :1. Adoption of high quality stainless steel material, anti-corrosion, anti-rust, safe and non-toxic for people to use. 2. 1 holed and 3 holed design makes it perfect outlets for seasonings.3. Cute and creative egg shape design make it a great decoration for desk.4. Ideal for store salt, pepper, other condiment, toothpick, etc.5. Perfect gift for housewarming gift or holiday gift, house decor gift for contemporary look. Specification :Condition:100% Brand NewMaterial: Stainless SteelColor: As Pictures ShownSize: approx.7*5.5cm/2.8*2.2inType: Single, Three Holes(optional)Weight: Approx.48g/1.7oz Package list: 1 * Spice Bottle(1 hole or 3 holes bottle) Notice: 1. Please allow 0~1 inch error due to manual measurement. Thanks for your understanding.2. Monitors are not calibrated same, item color displayed in photos may be showing slightly different from the real object. Please take the real one as standard.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613j+UlLCHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Omabeta","source_asin":"B0916XV5R9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0916XV5R9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0916XV5R9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":817781,"name":"Fox by The Macneil Studio, 24x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PeAF3Uf7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a watchful fox sitting behind its cub. Richard macneil, a self taught artist, formed the macneil studio in 2009 with his wife Judy and their sons Daniel and Kyle. Born in Winchester, macneil started his working life as an artist at Worcester royal porcelain and has always worked in the fields of sculpture, ceramics, and illustration, both in the UK and internationally. He spent many years living on the East coast of the USA, then returned to Worcestershire and freelanced as an artist and greeting card designer. Richard spends any spare time he has with his family walking in the beautiful British countryside and fishing. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PeAF3Uf7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B06ZZCBZS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817781","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06ZZCBZS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06ZZCBZS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
