window.products.push({"id":817788,"name":"Serta | Super Soft Microplush Electric Warming Blanket with 5 Heat Settings, Auto-Shut Off & Overheat Protection, King, Charcoal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zvCe1iEEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For those that are looking for a value priced heated blanket this 175 gsm plush with our Serta heating elements is just the product to promote. Did you know that turning your thermostat down by 10-15 degrees for a minimum of 8 hours is an effective way to lower energy costs by 5-15%? Who doesn't want to save money? With a 5-setting heat control, you can be prepared for a fall evening, or a winter snow storm. Ready for the morning, no worries if you dash out in a hurry and forget to turn your electric blanket off. Serta has created a 10-hour automatic shut-off and overheat feature that keeps you and your home safe and sound. Twin and Full sizes have one controller, while Queen and King each have dual controls. 19 Ft. cord. 5-year limited .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zvCe1iEEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Serta","source_asin":"B086D78DTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817788","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086D78DTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086D78DTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
