window.products.push({"id":817792,"name":"Ourokhome Salad Spinner Dryer Washer, Large Hand Crank professional Kitchen Gadgets with Bowl and Colander, Easy Cleaning, Washing, Drying Vegetables,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HnZBNfsdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✦ Salad prep has never been so easy: Do you still have a headache from the tedious salad preparation? Are you still drying your salad with tons of kitchen wipes? Still fretting about the water that fills your kitchen every time you make a salad? Ourokhome rotary salad spinner offers you the convenience of preparing your veggie salad! It will help you wash, clean, dry and serve greens, vegetables and fruits quickly and effortlessly and without sacrifice the crispness and texture of the greens. ✦ Unique handle of veggie spinner: Just by turning the handle, the built-in basket spins run fast enough to shake the water off the greens. Don’t worry about whether left-handed people can use it, as the handle can be turned clockwise or counterclockwise to get the same effect. In addition, our rotating handle is designed in a convex shape, there is a certain distance between the handle from the lid, so that your hand does not touch the lid when operating. ✦ Ergonomic design of lettuce spinner: The lid is equipped with a drainage system that you can drain water without opening the lid. The lock on lid to ensure the lid stable at a high speed of rotation. The clear bowl is made from food grade thickened ABS. It's more drop-resistant than other plastic salad spinner on the market. 4 non-slip pads on the bottom to keep the greens spinner stable. 4 L capacity ( 4.2 quarts) means you can process 3-4 servings of salad at a time. ✦ Versatile salad spinner, dryer, washer: No matter whether it is lettuce, broccoli, radicchio, arugula, spinach, frisee, endive, romaine, celery, parsley, cabbage, broad-leafed herbs or cress, you can dry it all effortlessly. Not just for salad, but also as a fruit washer before enjoying your berries and spin out any remaining water from pasta. In addition, the elegant bowl is perfect for serving, and basket can be used separately as a colander. ✦ Easy use and clean: No installation required. All parts are separate for easy use and clean. To clean this salad spinner, hand washing recommend, just wash with mild soap and damp with soft fabric. ✦ Suitable for gift giving: We have designed exquisite packaging and detailed manual, which is very suitable for housewarming, retirement, birthday gift. ✦ Customer Comes first: We have considerate after-sales service, if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HnZBNfsdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ourokhome","source_asin":"B0B2RF791P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2RF791P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2RF791P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
