window.products.push({"id":817832,"name":"Neaties Bamboo Wood Hangers | Walnut Finish | with 360° Degree Swivel Hook & Smooth Cut Notches | 24Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oihp1ZGfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Neaties Bamboo Wood Hangers are Made Using Grade \"A\" 100% Bamboo Wood. The Hook is Anti-Rust and can Swivel 360 Degrees. Includes a Strong Round Bar with a Clear High-Grade PVC Grooved Non-Slip Tube. These Hangers are Very Well Made and Expected to Last Years. Double Notch Feature on Both Sides to Secure Straps and Avoid Slips. The single Unit Dimension is approximately 17.5\"x9\"x1.5\". Perfect Size for Average Adult. Set of 24. Cedar and Regular Wood Options are also available in 12pk or 24pk. simply search \"Neaties\" on Amazon.com!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oihp1ZGfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neaties","source_asin":"B084LX3QF6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817832","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084LX3QF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084LX3QF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":817833,"name":"Howard Miller Forbes II Curio Cabinet, Espresso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":2273.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hXY6CzlBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Forbes Curio Cabinet II by Howard Miller has an Espresso finish. Locking front door. Beveled glass slides in both directions. Two incandescent lights. No Reach roller light switch. Glass mirrored back. Five adjustable shelves, six levels of display. Pad-Lock metal shelf clips. Adjustable floor levelers. Plate grooves. Made in the USA.Howard C. Miller founded the company back in 1926, at the age of 21, and is based out of Zeeland, Michigan. Even though Howard Miller understood the need to create products that would be steeped in quality and value, he expected nothing less than the best. From gaining the title “World’s Largest Grandfather Clock Manufacturer” in the 1960s, to creating collectors’ cabinets in 1989, all the products have the same attention to detail and handcrafted ideals. We offer hundreds of items to complement any décor ranging from portable alarm clocks to desk sets to wall and mantel clocks to collectors’ cabinets to limited edition grandfather clocks. You will always have the same condition that Howard C. Miller provided when he began offering clocks more than 70 years ago: that quality is reflected both in the products we create.Howard Miller offers a warranty which is our promise and commitment that our products have been manufactured using the finest materials and have been thoroughly inspected prior to being shipped from our facilities. Our warranty is available exclusively through authorized retailers only. Please inquire with any 3rd party seller prior to purchase to confirm warranty eligibility. Purchases made from unauthorized retailers will not be eligible for warranty services through Howard Miller or its authorized service center network.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hXY6CzlBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B0C5PJ2QWJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5PJ2QWJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5PJ2QWJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":817834,"name":"Coffee Containers with Shelf,Coffee Bean Storage,Coffee Grounds Container, 42 oz,2 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lXxvzDX6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Coffee containers with storage box】This coffee Containers set includes :Two 42oz glass storage jars,a wooden spoon,and a storage box with non-slip design.They are suitable for coffee bar and coffee station in home or company 【Coffee Containers】Those Coffee Containers are designed mainly to store coffee beans and ground coffee to keep coffee fresh. If you are struggling with the wrong taste of coffee due to improper storage of coffee beans, this coffee container might be a good choice. 【Coffee storage airtight canister】Because the 304 food-grade stainless steel buckle and the wooden cover with rubber ring cooperate with each other, the airtightness of coffee beans storage is stronger, which can further ensure the freshness of the stored items. 【Glass storage containers】Since some customers don't like plastic, we choose glass as raw material. The coffee containers are made of high-quality lead-free borosilicate glass. it is BPA free,which is healthy and harmless .Some customers are worried that the glass jar was broken when received, so we especially thicken it. 【Multipurpose jar】This storage containers can not only store coffee beans,you can also store things like tea leaves, nuts, rice,sugar, etc. If you are interested, you can also develop more functions. 【Our servies】Before the coffee storage container is sent to you, we have carried out sample inspections to ensure that the product is qualified. If the damage is caused by transportation problems, please contact us through Amazon as soon as possible, we will consult your opinions and solve them properly for you. 【Listen to you】We insist on building amazing products at honest prices. For more product details, please continue to browse the page to ensure that this product is suitable for your needs. If you have any suggestions, you can also contact us through Amazon, we will actively listen to your suggestions and develop better products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lXxvzDX6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"zunmial","source_asin":"B0B5RNG77Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817834","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5RNG77Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5RNG77Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
