window.products.push({"id":817899,"name":"Howard Miller Mia Wall Clock 625-603 – Worn Black Home Decor with Quartz Single-Chime Movement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":439.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mx2LprsTL._AC_SL1452_.jpg","description":"WALL CLOCK: This Mia Wall Clock features a worn black finish with red and brown undertones on select hardwoods and veneers to compliment your home decor. It has fluted columns with raised beveled column caps, flat glass, and brass pendulum bob with a harp and lyre. DURABLE: The wooden frame will relieve stress in a busy household. Hang it in the kitchen, office, or living room for a piece with aged black traditional Roman numerals (IIII instead of IV), black serpentine hands, and a brushed antique-brass finished bezel to stand out over the aged dial. CHIMES: Easily tell time with single-chime movement that plays the Westminster chime to strike each hour. Set the automatic nighttime chime shut-off for convenient volume control to have anywhere in your house. DIMENSIONS: The height is 25.75 inches (65 cm), with a width of 12.5 inches (32 cm) and a depth of 6.25 inches (16 cm). It is powered by quartz, single-chime movement and requires four AA sized batteries (not included). HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world’s leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mx2LprsTL._AC_SL1452_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B00R9HU3R2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817899","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00R9HU3R2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00R9HU3R2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
