window.products.push({"id":817905,"name":"Homorey Ice Cube Trays For Freezer with Spill-Resistant Removeable lid - BPA Free & Dishwasher Safe Ice Cube Molds with Ice Cube Bin, Ice Scooper & Ic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eJwT2cJjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧊 AN ABSOLUTE ICE SOLUTION: The Homorey ice cube tray with lid is made of BPA-free food-grade plastic and is the ideal solution for all of your health issues! Our spill-resistant ice tray, durable ice cube mold is odorless and freezer safe, unlike the normal cheap stinky disposable ice trays. To get the perfect shaped clear ice cubes, all you have to do is twist the ice cube tray once and pop the ice cubes out of the ice mold. 🧊 MULTI-LAYER STACKING ICE TRAY - For people who want to get dozens of ice cubes in one go and have very short freezing space, the Homorey ice trays for freezer with lid is a must have. This 5-in-1 set includes 2 ice cube trays for freezer with removable lids, 1 ice box, 1 ice scooper, and 1 ice tong. The spacious ice bin has the space to hold more than 155 ice cubes and the lids protect the ice cubes from all kinds of smells and from contaminating with other stuff in the freezer. 🧊 EASY TO USE AND DISHWASHER SAFE - Our practical and versatile ice cube molds and small ice cube trays can handle low temperatures well without cracking and are very convenient for your day to day use. All you have to do is fill the stackable ice cube trays for freezer with water, put the lid on, and keep the trays in the freezer and you will get the perfect shaped ice. To clean the plastic ice cube ice maker tray, you can just simply put them into your dishwasher after use or hand wash them with soap and water. 🧊 DESIGN TO MEET YOUR DIVERSE NEEDS - The 2 layered covered ice cube trays can provide you with a total of 110 mini nugget shaped ice cubes which makes it easy to cater parties as well as family and friends get-togethers. You can also fill the ice cube mold with your desired stuff such as fruits, iced coffee, juices, soups, chocolates, smoothies, baby food, etc to make ice cubes of your choice. 🧊 CUSTOMER SERVICE - Please feel free to contact us if you have any queries regarding our stackable ice cube trays. We offer immediate support and a hassle-free return and exchange policy at Homorey to provide our customers with a risk free and seamless experience. Order now and say goodbye to the poorly designed ice trays!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eJwT2cJjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homorey","source_asin":"B0BFMNMS9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-817905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFMNMS9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFMNMS9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
